		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">RAM Legacy Stock Assessment Database</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>http://ramlegacy.org/</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">The RAM Legacy Stock Assessment Database is a compilation of stock assessment results for commercially exploited marine populations from around the world.  The recently updated database offers many graphical and analytic tools to explore the data, as well as new data sets including; assessments from N.W. Africa, assessments from the Mediterranean Sea, assessments from Chile, data sets on Pacific salmon. The database is seeking collaborators to cover parts of the world that we are missing.</r3d:description>
